#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Before anything is sent, the editor sets up each channel the review will use: the review sheet, the GitHub issue forms, an offline Excel sheet and a Google Form, each constrained to the release's fixed references, with precise instructions, all links, and how submitters are recorded. Skills: public-comment-channels, public-comment, review-sheet-script."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/public-comment-release.bpmn:70
#. Diagram label
msgid "Build the public comment release"
msgstr ""

