#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Builds the frozen public comment release (line-numbered PDF and a permanent PC/<version> site that is not deleted when branches merge) and archives it with the review once comment closes."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/public-comment-release.bpmn:106
#. Diagram label
msgid "Comment closed, release archived"
msgstr ""

