#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Decide when the draft goes out and send it: the committee and the editor agree the release date and comment period, and announce it to the public. They own the release, not its build."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/public-comment-release.bpmn:88
