msgid "Draft ready for public comment"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/public-comment-release.bpmn:95
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Each comment that comes back through any channel is ingested and placed, triaged, grouped by theme into change sets, recommended on by the committee and decided by the editor (Process_PublicComment)."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/public-comment-release.bpmn:47
#. Diagram label
msgid "Editor"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/public-comment-release.bpmn:71
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Freeze the draft as \"Draft for Public Comment Release vX\": a PDF with fixed line numbers and a site copy under a permanent PC/<version>/ path (not branches/, never deleted on merge). Every channel cites this release's pages, lines and block ids. Line numbers run continuously through the document. Freeze from a FULL build: dispatch the preview workflow for the branch with build_type: full first, because a preview borrows main's search index and slices; pc:release freeze refuses a preview build. Run `bun run cat pc:pdf` for the line-numbered PDF and its line map, then `bun run cat pc:release freeze` for the write-once copy under PC/<version>/. Skill: document-publishing."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/public-comment-release.bpmn:48
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Prepares everything a commenter needs before anything is sent: every channel set up and constrained to the release's fixed references, with precise instructions and links, and the announcement written."
msgstr ""

